"MS":{"INSTRUMENT_NAME":"Thermo Q Exactive HF hybrid Orbitrap","INSTRUMENT_TYPE":"Orbitrap","MS_TYPE":"ESI","ION_MODE":"NEGATIVE","MS_COMMENTS":"LC-MS/MS raw data were imported, processed, normalized and reviewed using Progenesis QI v.2.1 (Non-linear Dynamics, Newcastle, UK). All FMS, DDA and PRM sample runs were chromatographically aligned against a QC reference run. Following peak picking, unique spectral features (retention time and m/z pairs) were grouped based on adducts and isotopes, and individual features or metabolites were normalized to all features. Further filtering was carried out by removing features or metabolites that had &gt;30% coefficient of variance.","MS_RESULTS_FILE":"ST001339_AN002233_results.txt UNITS:peak area Has m/z:Yes Has RT:Yes RT units:Minutes"},

